{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong>\u00a0<strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<i> A Booty-Huntin\u2019 Roguelite Voxel Adventure!\u00a0</i>\ud83e\udded</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/842fe345e7453bdd334440c9adab0ac7.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=200 /></span>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Welcome to Battle Island</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A wild, procedurally generated 3D island overrun by skeleton hordes, cursed kings, and hidden treasure! In this stylized pirate fantasy roguelite voxel game, you'll need grit, teamwork, and a good swing o\u2019 the cutlass to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/68c716fc0838a89ed02d92cba8308474.poster.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/68c716fc0838a89ed02d92cba8308474.webm?t=1763278402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeleton armies rise from the earth to conquer the island, and only you and your crew can stop them. Fight off endless waves of bone rattling enemies in fast paced, skill based melee combat. Work together, build and defend your fort, and take down the dreaded Skeleton King. When the dust settles (for a day), it\u2019s your chance to <strong>loot, mine, build, and prepare for the next invasion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/953065fb18c8e239ee9ba329ed12955b.poster.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/953065fb18c8e239ee9ba329ed12955b.webm?t=1763278402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Procedural Islands,\u00a0</strong>Smoothly blended terrain, stylized 3D environments, and vibrant textures bring Battle Island to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong> Survival Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINE:</strong> For treasure and rare ores across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD:</strong> Everything from huts to massive fortresses or hidden bunkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT:</strong>\u00a0Weapons, armor, and gear from a wide variety of resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/c4df2d71dc26f57224e9ec52ed5d7fee.poster.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/c4df2d71dc26f57224e9ec52ed5d7fee.webm?t=1763278402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new pirate melee system with a focus on skill based swordplay, punchy feedback, and a splash of cartoonish chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP Multiplayer:</strong> Defend the island with your crew against waves of AI skeletons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Private or Public:</strong> Host a local session for friends or open it up to the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/26d2d630979f8058d8e3a2b1638f2f36.poster.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/26d2d630979f8058d8e3a2b1638f2f36.webm?t=1763278402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Stylized Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, bold textures, charming character models, and explosive toony particle effects make every battle pop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2693 <strong>Join the Crew!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re constantly updating the game with new features, bug fixes, and content. Jump in now to get early access, join the growing pirate community, and help shape the future of <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/e1194aa7546ce360025dbf7bfa68621b.poster.avif?t=1763278402\" width=600 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612750/extras/e1194aa7546ce360025dbf7bfa68621b.webm?t=1763278402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Development\u2019s Full Steam Ahead!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re hard at work getting <strong>YAARRGH! Battle Island!</strong> ready for launch. Want a sneak peek behind the scenes? <strong>Follow our journey on YouTube</strong> and stay up to date with 